  <name>Feishin</name>
  <summary>Jellyfin, Navidrome, and OpenSubsonic compatible music player</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Feishin is a modern, cross-platform music player for self-hosted music servers.
      It is a complete rewrite of Sonixd with a fresh UI and expanded backend support.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Supports Navidrome, Jellyfin, and OpenSubsonic-compatible servers</li>
      <li>MPV and web player backends</li>
      <li>Scrobble playback to your server</li>
      <li>Smart playlist editor (Navidrome)</li>
      <li>Synchronized and unsynchronized lyrics support</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

